# Public Frontend Rules

- Follow `information-architecture.md`, `design-system.md`, and `wireframes-and-interactions.md`.
- Prefer server rendering for editorial/SEO content.
- Minimize client JavaScript.
- No autoplay video on Home.
- No mandatory account.
- Respect Campus context without hiding cross-campus content.
- Stable direct URLs for core entities.
- Loading/empty/error/temporal states are required.
- Use shared semantic tokens/components.
- Avoid generic all-card layouts.
- Target WCAG 2.2 AA.
- Test mobile and throttled networks.
